      "writtenOn": "2019-12-05T14:42:01Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I updated to print the __FILE__ and __LINE__ along with the optional message. That makes the first error line you see contain the most useful information.\n\nI added this example to the commit message, but here is the output\n\n...\n  CC      RW/chip/npcx/gpio.o\n  CC      RW/chip/npcx/header.o\nIn file included from include/common.h:13,\n                 from include/adc.h:11,\n                 from board/phaser/board.c:8:\ninclude/compile_time_macros.h:13:2: error: static assertion failed: \"board/phaser/board.c:74: Size mismatch\"\n  _Static_assert(cond, file \":\" #line \": \" msg)\n\n....",
      "parentUuid": "f1035440_ba644807",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 14,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 14,
        "endChar": 41
      },
      "revId": "7b247eff7bb3e774d5bef0de5e2b7b2863bba60f",
