      "writtenOn": "2019-12-04T19:52:42Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I think the __LINE__ hack was to prevent using duplicate identifiers when multiple BUILD_ASSERTs happened in the same file. _Static_assert should show the file and line number, and we don\u0027t have the identifier concern anymore, so we can get rid of this hack.",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 16,
